# KeyHack grammar rules, English. Copyright 2026 The KeyHack Authors.
# Apache License 2.0. Written for KeyHack; add rules freely.
#
# Format: see grammar/pt.rules. "a" versus "an" is checked in code
# (GrammarChecker), with the dictionary, not here.

# --- modal + "of"
should|could|would|must|might|may of => $1 have

# --- subject and verb (the guard skips questions: "did he have", "does it do")
!did|does|do|will|would|could|should|can|may|might|must|to|let|make|makes|made|help|helps|had|shall|cannot|didn't|doesn't|don't|won't|wouldn't|couldn't|shouldn't|can't he|she|it have => $1 has
!did|does|do|will|would|could|should|can|may|might|must|to|let|make|makes|made|help|helps|had|shall|cannot|didn't|doesn't|don't|won't|wouldn't|couldn't|shouldn't|can't he|she|it do => $1 does
he|she|it don't => $1 doesn't
he|she|it haven't => $1 hasn't
he|she|it aren't => $1 isn't
he|she|it are => $1 is
i|you|we|they doesn't => $1 don't
i|you|we|they hasn't => $1 haven't
!did|does|do|will|would|could|should|can|may|might|must|to|let|make|makes|made|help|helps|had|shall i|you|we|they has => $1 have
you|we|they is => $1 are
you|we|they isn't => $1 aren't
you|we|they was => $1 were
you|we|they wasn't => $1 weren't
i is|are => $1 am
!have|has|had|i've|you've|we've|they've|haven't|hasn't i|you|we|they|he|she seen => $1 saw

# --- easily confused words
your welcome => you're welcome
your|ur not|gonna => you're $2
their is|are|was|were => there $2
its a|an|the|not|been|gonna|going|so|very|really|just|also|still|always|never|ok|okay|fine|true|getting => it's $2
more|less|better|worse|rather|other|bigger|smaller|faster|slower|higher|lower|greater|older|younger|larger|cheaper|easier|harder|longer|shorter then => $1 than
to|gonna|will|might|could|would|don't|didn't|not|never loose => $1 lose
